# The sdist already carries `tests/`, and tests/test_client_assets.py asserts
# against the host integration assets.  Without this graft the sdist would ship
# a test suite it cannot pass (Phase 10.3 builds and runs an unpacked, non-Git
# sdist), so `clients/` has to travel with it.
graft clients

# `docs/ide-mcp-setup.md` deliberately lives in the repository root, outside
# this distribution.  test_client_assets.py detects that it is running outside a
# repo checkout and skips the IDE-document assertions with an explicit reason
# rather than silently passing.
